kseexpr: kseexpr (embeddable expression evaluation engine)
kseexpr:
kseexpr: SeExpr for Krita is the fork of Disney Animation's SeExpr expression
kseexpr: library that is used in Krita. This fork was created as part of the
kseexpr: GSoC 2020 project "Dynamic Fill Layers in Krita using SeExpr" to
kseexpr: enable the provision of fixes and translations needed to embed SeExpr
kseexpr: into the Krita painting suite.
kseexpr: WARNING: This version is not ABI-compatible with projects using
kseexpr: upstream SeExpr. Use it at your own discretion.
